s each, and 837 independent result comparisons. All 36 changes are additive; retained source-owner blobs match the measured parent exactly.\n\nWeights and all 62 frozen outputs are archived in the [immutable 135-file Hugging Face release](https://huggingface.co/Publicus/legal-ir-autoencoder/tree/fa37360840c070f9318d6ad2baef87d785eac504/releases/20261013-actor-boundary-v1). Fresh development/test complete IR remains 0/36 each; statutory examples remain unscored. The report also compares the existing temporal and actor branches and identifies the existing ranking-loss implementation for the next bounded comparison.\n","created_at":"2026-10-13T18:35:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:37:22Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T18:37:22Z","merged_at":"2026-10-13T18:37:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"c9d0f016a9fcfa327346e056e38e2ffa3b25ffa0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/1297/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/1297/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/issues/1297/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/endomorphosis/ipfs_datasets_py/statuses/04dd69b76b3c14718281d1c4ded53b721f09c328","head":{"label":"endomorphosis:codex/legal-actor-boundary-20261013-01","ref":"codex/legal-actor-boundary-20261013-01","sha":"04dd69b76b3c14718281d1c4ded53b721f09c328","user":{"login":"endomorphosis","id":3405202,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDUyMDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3405202?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis","html_url":"https://github.com/endomorphosis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/endomorphosis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/